        "id": 213774,
        "name": "cnranger",
        "username": "cnranger",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/53a042/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-26T16:05:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Paraphrasing:</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"MindWanderer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/48/4816_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MindWanderer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Time-travel … it's very confusing.I get the impression that C&amp;A … don't totally have a grasp of [time-travel] either.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Yep!</p>\n<p>I think any time travel where you can change the past to change your future is at best confusing and at worst doesn't make any sense at all. However it can be highly entertaining if you don't think about it too hard.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
