        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lightningrod/{size}/2143_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-29T06:12:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I really loved that they took the time to fill out the rules of time travel and clarify so much! It was also cool getting my question answered but the best was the Idea of the Spawn of Baron Blade!&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What i learned pretty much boils down to \"Don't travel through time unless you have a boat or a robot friend.\"</p>",
